# Corrected version (added in task 2.1.3, committed before it runs) of 236, whose
# source lent a fixed array as a view (E10200); the original stays with its observed outcome.
# WS2-07. spec/03 §7 and spec/16 BR-9: a global may not be borrowed (E10038).
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: reject E10038
contrast: bump(borrow counter);\n    println($"{counter}"); ==> let local: i32 = counter;\n    bump(borrow local);\n    println($"{local}");
contrast-expect: output
--- contrast-output
2
